     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi,<div>This is the part were you want to plot green points on top of  the original box plot. For the legend part, I am not sure.</div><div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-size:16.6px;font-family:Monaco\"><span style=\"color:#071a99\">qplot(</span>data<span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span>mdat<span style=\"color:#071a99\">,</span>x<span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span>variable<span style=\"color:#071a99\">,</span>y<span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span>value<span style=\"color:#071a99\">,</span>geom<span style=\"color:#071a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;boxplot&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#071a99\">)+</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-size:16.6px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">geom_point(<span style=\"color:#000000\">data</span>=data.frame(<span style=\"color:#000000\">variable</span>=colnames(<span style=\"color:#000000\">dat</span>),<span style=\"color:#000000\">value</span>=<span style=\"color:#000000\">beta1</span>),<span style=\"color:#000000\">colour</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;green&quot;</span>)</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-size:16.6px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\"><br></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-size:16.6px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">Best wishes,</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-size:16.6px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(7,26,153)\">Ana</div><div></div></div></div>"
